Subject: [PATCH] Keep SP particle-loader samples inside owned cells

Use a SYCL-safe nextafter helper and source-cell ownership checks when loading
particles at single-precision domain or tile endpoints. Move endpoint samples
one representable value inward, validate finite radial remapping, and repair
only particles owned by the current tile. Preserve the existing chunked scan
and source-channel paths.

